OL,3,GNEWSA'Paul Hollywood said my cheesecake
OL,4,Awas five star'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA contestant on the Great British Bake
OL,7,FOff said the experience was
OL,8,F"life-changing" and helped her discover
OL,9,Fmore about herself.
OL,11,FProject planner Shannon, from the
OL,12,FForest of Dean in Gloucestershire, said
OL,13,Fa big highlight was making friends with
OL,14,Fthe other contestants.
OL,16,FShe told BBC Radio Gloucestershire that
OL,17,Fbeing able to look behind the scenes of
OL,18,Fhow TV shows are produced made her
OL,19,Fconsider a career in the sector, and
OL,20,Fleft the show with some moments of
OL,21,Fpraise from the judges to treasure.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
