OL,3,GNEWSA'Paul Hollywood said my cheesecake
OL,4,Awas five star'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I did get a comment from Paul
OL,7,FHollywood and he said [a cheesecake she
OL,8,Fmade] looked 'five-star gourmet' so I
OL,9,Fwill take that with me for the rest of
OL,10,Fmy life," Shannon said.
